{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0thcnp6enolMjAlMjgyMDA4JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Karzzzz","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/i6GpnblgEqcBgRMhW5ZdGYxtVhK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vgfATZOtNSAhf0tLVUNTkW0pVg1.jpg","description":"Singer/Dancer Monty Oberoi meets and falls in love with Tina. He then starts hallucinating and having visions of an unknown place. His doctors advise him to take a break and he decides to travel to Kenya, where Tina resides with her uncle, Kabira, and guardian, Kamini. Monty experiences more incidents and feels as if he has been here before, while Tina notices that he appears to be more attracted to Kamini than herself. Neither are aware that Monty will soon be entrapped in a plot that will result in his sudden death.","releaseInfo":"2008","genres":["Action","Romance","Thriller","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"3.1","runtime":"142 min","cast":["Himesh Reshammiya","Urmila Matondkar","Shweta Kumar","Dino Morea","Raj Babbar","Danny Denzongpa","Gulshan Grover","Rohini Hattangadi"],"director":["Satish Kaushik"],"released":"2008-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Vengeance is Back","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Himesh Reshammiya","character":"Monty Oberoi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/klaNPMWG9caEA0BG33LdAzn3Cwn.jpg"},{"name":"Urmila Matondkar","character":"Kamini R. Verma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1jRBxCEwCXqITxbjn5ppXWRTJ29.jpg"},{"name":"Shweta Kumar","character":"Tina"},{"name":"Dino Morea","character":"Ravi Shantaprasad Verma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/76sUAgf1NYDEPNqED647RgkcsQX.jpg"},{"name":"Raj Babbar","character":"G.G. Oberoi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/czcJMiNDxfQrNnDPNBM2O6cTmZR.jpg"},{"name":"Danny Denzongpa","character":"Kabira","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xDNLtgG8iDXxNRvSDjpuNSNfKvX.jpg"},{"name":"Gulshan Grover","character":"Sir Juda","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/